# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Content-removal-sensitive static site: force edge revalidation so a removed or
# changed file propagates immediately instead of lingering in edge cache. On
# 2026-07-17 two removed ADRs stayed served from edge cache for up to 7 days
# because static assets (.md/.json) defaulted to `s-maxage=604800`, while the
# HTML pages (which used the policy below) did not linger. Applying the
# revalidating policy site-wide closes that class.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
